Package: deephelp
Type: Package
Title: Translate R Help Pages to Chinese with DeepSeek
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Shi", "", email = "1902186493@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Renders on-the-fly Simplified-Chinese translations of R help pages
    in the help pane of RStudio or Positron, using the DeepSeek chat model with
    reasoning (thinking mode) disabled for fast, low-cost, clean output. Works as
    a drop-in replacement for '?' and 'help()'. Translations are cached on disk.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: httr, jsonlite, tools, utils
Suggests: rstudioapi
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
